  "summary": "I was born and raised in colorful Colorado Springs, Colorado. In my free time I intently watch movies, play soccer, and yell at video games.\n\nI taught myself how to code and design games at age eleven. I have worked professionally in both Unreal Engine and Unity making both 2D and 3D games for PC, Mac, PS4, Xbox One, iPhone, and Android. I have solo-developed shipped games.\n\nI now work heavily with Unreal Engine 4 designing VR and AR training solutions for the military and police. My role is to utilize UE4’s features and tools to create the most immersive and successful training environment using a vast variety of hardware including weapons, trackers, tablets, haptic devices, and more.",
